      "signature": "(iSkillID, dSkillInfo, dattackInfo)",
      "kind": "function",
      "summary": {
        "text": "按技能类型创建表现命令对象：skillType = dSkillInfo[e_comskilldefine.SKILL_DATA_TYPE]；先 e_debugctrl.DebugPrint('skillType = ', skillType)；命中 SKILLTYPE_CMD 则 SKILLTYPE_CMD[skillType](iSkillID, dSkillInfo, dattackInfo)（映射值是类本身，这里是实例化）；未命中打 LOG_DEBUG('-_-b 該指令處於失聯狀態！！！', iSkillID, skillType) 并隐式返回 None。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "wc_create",
          "n5_census_all"
        ]
      },
      "calls": [
        "LOG_DEBUG",
        "e_debugctrl.DebugPrint"
      ],
